dvtm
Usage: dvtm

Splits one terminal into panes, so you can watch several things at once -- a
scan in one, its output in another. No server and no config: it runs on top of
`abduco`, which keeps the whole set alive when you detach. The modifier key is
`ctrl-g` -- press it, then a command key.

	ctrl-g c   open a new pane
	ctrl-g j   move to the next pane
	ctrl-g k   move to the previous pane
	ctrl-g x   close the focused pane

See also: abduco
